Keiki Coloring was designed to boost toddlers’ and preschoolers’ creativity, develop problem-solving and motor skills, increase attentiveness and concentration, learn ABC, and numbers through play.

Supported by early learning experts our team developed following themes of coloring pages:
Early learning packs:
- ABC. Helps to learn letters effectively;
- Numbers. Your kid will enjoy coloring funny pics while remembering numbers;
- Tracing. Toddlers will love these coloring pages with letters and a big amount of different tools;
- Tracing. Toddlers will love these coloring pages which help them to develop creativity along with fine motor skills;
Developing hobbies and interests packs:
- Princesses. Kids will enjoy coloring cute funny characters;
- Cartoons. Preschoolers enjoy cute style of such pics;
- Dinosaurs. One of the most favorite themes for children of all age groups is among our coloring pages;
- Vehicles. Your little one will be able to color nice cars, buses, taxis, etc;
- Holidays. Your kid can prepare lovely greeting cards for mommy, daddy, and other relatives;
Free drawing mode.
It helps your child to develop creativity and motor skills. Let your kid express fantasy and imagination.

Our main goal is to support you in the development of your kid. This app will definitely fit children of all ages. This game is transforming kid’s screen time into a fun and interactive opportunity to learn through play!

Main features:
Different tools, colors and patterns
2 modes
Learning mechanics
Kids’ most favorite themes
Perfect for all ages
100% kids safe and ads-free

Download Keiki Coloring now and you will see efficient educational games while your child will have fun!

By subscribing to Keiki you can be sure that the app will get only better: there is a whole team of professionals behind Keiki making games for children more engaging, useful, and fun, creating and uploading more and more content with every next update of the app.

We value each subscriber that's why every opinion and feedback are priceless for us, so do not hesitate to share it, and be sure it will be heard.

A little technical details to know about Keiki Coloring subscription:

Once the free Keiki trial period is over, users are automatically charged the standard price specified in the app. Once confirmed, the payment is charged to the user’s iTunes account.


As a rule, AppStore renews subscriptions at least 24 hrs before the current period end date. To find all the information on managing the subscriptions billed through Apple, please go to your iTunes account.
